                                                                                
  Usage: bab why [OPTIONS] [JOBID]                                              
                                                                                
  Explain why a pending job has not started and what would start it now.        
  Without JOBID, cover each of your jobs waiting for resources.                 
                                                                                
  Options                                                                       
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  
       --nodes                          add a per-node table                    
       --fix     [auto|mem|cpus|gpus]   edit the job so it starts now (auto:    
                                        best mem/cpus change)                   
  -y   --yes                            apply --fix without asking              
  -h   --help                           Show this message and exit.             
                                                                                
                                                                                
